#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm.rst:2
msgid "HVM 1.3 Clusters"
msgstr "HVM 1.3 Clústeres"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm.rst:6
msgid ""
"The HVM 1.3 cluster layout introduces a new agent-based quorum system for "
"|morpheus| hypervisor clusters. This layout replaces the previous Pacemaker-"
"based high availability stack with the |morpheus| agent's "
"QuorumCheckService, providing simplified cluster management, faster failure "
"detection, and integrated fencing."
msgstr ""
"El HVM 1.3 cluster layout introduces un nuevo agent-based quorum sistema "
"para |morpheus| hypervisor clusters. Este layout replaces el anterior "
"Pacemaker-based alta disponibilidad stack con el |morpheus| agent's "
"QuorumCheckService, providing simplified cluster gestión, faster fallo "
"detection, y integrated fencing."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm.rst:8
msgid ""
"HVM 1.3 clusters utilize KVM-based virtualization with Corosync for cluster "
"membership, DLM for distributed lock management, and the |morpheus| agent "
"for quorum decisions, failure detection, and automated recovery."
msgstr ""
"HVM 1.3 clusters utilize KVM-based virtualization con Corosync para cluster "
"membership, DLM para distributed lock gestión, y el |morpheus| agent para "
"quorum decisions, fallo detection, y automated recuperación."
